    <item>
      <title>Intelligent Advertisement Recommendation for an Online Sales Platform Based on Implicit User Preference Acquisition and Geospatial Conditions</title>
      <link>/project/2020-sadosky-region-global/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>/project/2020-sadosky-region-global/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The project aims to develop a prototype that connects buyers and sellers through an intelligent characterization of each user, considering their short-term preferences and defining geospatial characteristics. This approach enables smart alerts about items of interest within nearby geographic areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key focus of the project is ensuring easy adoption by acquiring user knowledge in a non-intrusive way using pre-existing information. Additionally, it emphasizes deducing the geolocation of product and service listings, which is particularly important for individual users who are often reluctant to share such information.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
